From a96770042f9e260039147be78a2dc7ad21f1c20c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 20 Jun 2026 15:17:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] =?UTF-8?q?feat:=20admin=20debug=20panel=20=E2=80=94?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20payment=20health=20+=20fix=20blank=20tab=20+=20live=20error?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20capture?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Surfaces payment/access problems in the admin panel before clients report
them, and makes the Debug tab actually usable.

- admin.html: fix nesting bug where page-debug and page-reset were inside
  the hidden page-usage, so the Debug/Reset tabs rendered blank. They are
  now siblings inside .content.
- Add a "Payment Health" section: Square config status (signature key /
  access token / webhook URL — the silent killers), payments that arrived
  without an extractable email (paid but no access), users who paid but
  haven't registered yet, and recently provisioned paying users to confirm
  the webhook is working.
- Add a live JS error capturer (uncaught errors, unhandled rejections,
  failed resources, console.error/warn) into its own "Live JS Errors"
  panel so it doesn't clash with the server-side error_logs view.
- server.js: add GET /api/admin/debug/payments and fix the debug test that
  checked the wrong env var (SQUARE_WEBHOOK_SIG -> SQUARE_WEBHOOK_SIGNATURE),
  plus add Square access-token and payment-columns checks.

